    },
    {
      "codepath": "UE5 classic FObjectImport table",
      "exact_source_differential": "Both releases have package-name support, but UE5.8.3 ObjectResource.cpp adds cooked/editor filtering for PackageName serialization. FName import metadata cannot be projected as an unconditional identical field layout."
    },
    {
      "codepath": "UE5 Zen global import/package store",
      "exact_source_differential": "Both use FPackageId/FPackageObjectIndex, imported package IDs and public export hashes. UE5.8.3 adds FCellExportMapEntry and Verse-path import hash handling; do not infer these from 5.0.0."
    },
    {
      "codepath": "UE5 policy selection",
      "exact_source_differential": "The existing UnrealDB UE5 5.8.3 Zen and classic source policies remain separate. This audit is not authority to apply a 5.8.3 parser to 5.0.0 or certify all versions without genuine early package bytes and source-specific tests."
